		Section lauds_feast_and_consecration_and_church_saint
			when-date-is
				Jan 10 use:
					Insert_section CONS.DateSetting__.Reset_to_Default End-Insert
					Insert_section CONS.MA_13_Lauds__.feast__.as_123 End-Insert
					Insert_section MA._13_Lauds__.consecration__.p_123as456 End-Insert
				Mar 17 use:
					Insert_section CONS.DateSetting__.Reset_to_Default End-Insert
					Insert_section CONS.MA_13_Lauds__.feast__.as_123 End-Insert
					Insert_section MA._13_Lauds__.consecration__.p_123as456 End-Insert
				Apr 24 use:
					Insert_section CONS.DateSetting__.Reset_to_Default End-Insert
					Insert_section CONS.MA_13_Lauds__.feast__.as_123 End-Insert
					Insert_section MA._13_Lauds__.consecration__.p_123as456 End-Insert
				May 9 use:
